      "description": "Admissions Information Sessions This website uses scripting to enhance your browsing experience. Enable JavaScript in your browser and then reload this website. This website uses resources that are being blocked by your network. Contact your network administrator for more information. Skip to main content University of New Haven Undergraduate Admissions Information Sessions & Campus Tours Designed for families beginning the college search process who are interested in exploring the University of New Haven. Your visit will include a presentation that highlights our academic offerings, campus life, and the application/financial aid process, followed by a guided campus tour with one of our current students. Duration: Approximately 2 hours For students attending our events, we kindly ask that you limit your guests to two people (party of 3 total). Upcoming Info Sessions & Campus Tours Legend: Available Full Not Scheduled How Can We Help? Office of Undergraduate Admissions Anemone & Steven Kaplan Hall 300 Boston Post Rd West Haven, CT 06516-1916 United States (203) 932-7319 Admissions@newhaven.edu Helpful Links Request Info Apply Now The Application Process Financial Aid Information Transfer Students International Students Virtual Tours and Maps Meet Our Staff Accepted Students Opportunities for High School Students FAQs for Visitors Check out our Frequently Asked Questions Webpage for campus visitors to help you navigate the ins and outs of planning your trip to campus. Learn More University of New Haven 300 Boston Post Rd West Haven, CT 06516 203-932-7319 Social Media Facebook TikTok Instagram X YouTube LinkedIn"
